                <head>No. 30.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Baker
                        to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-09"><hi rendition="#italic">April 9,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>One hundred Nicaragua troops leave here to-morrow for Bluefields to perform
                    police duty.</p>
